    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Bubbles Must Die! is a tiny, highly-addictive bubble-shooter Inspired by the classic titles like Peggle, Arkanoid and Space Invaders.</strong><br><br><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong><br>Destroy all Space bubbles and save the World!<br>Don't let the Bubbles cross the bottom line, or the game will end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONTROLS:</strong><br><br><strong>AIM</strong> - Use Left &amp; Right\u00a0arrow\u00a0 or hold down the Left mouse button.<strong> </strong> <br><strong>SHOOT </strong>- Press SPACE\u00a0or release the Left mouse button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A excellent Family friendly coffee-break game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addictive and Simple gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite replayability as you chase ever higher scores!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >70 levels full of bubbles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable Color Themes and many special Bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of traps to avoid</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted pixel graphics created with love</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great music by Kevin MacLeod</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xbox 360 controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And Steam Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning</strong>: This game contains a lot of Bubbles! :O</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Bubbles Must Die! is a tiny, highly-addictive bubble-shooter Inspired by the classic titles like Peggle, Arkanoid and Space Invaders.</strong><br><br><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong><br>Destroy all Space bubbles and save the World!<br>Don't let the Bubbles cross the bottom line, or the game will end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONTROLS:</strong><br><br><strong>AIM</strong> - Use Left &amp; Right\u00a0arrow\u00a0 or hold down the Left mouse button.<strong> </strong> <br><strong>SHOOT </strong>- Press SPACE\u00a0or release the Left mouse button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A excellent Family friendly coffee-break game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addictive and Simple gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite replayability as you chase ever higher scores!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >70 levels full of bubbles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable Color Themes and many special Bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of traps to avoid</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted pixel graphics created with love</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great music by Kevin MacLeod</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xbox 360 controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And Steam Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning</strong>: This game contains a lot of Bubbles! :O</p>",
